e the rabbit (inferred fact).\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - The dog sees the rabbit, so the statement "The dog does not see the rabbit" is **false**. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 18%|#8        | 111/600 [1:24:30<17:56:59, 132.15s/it]
