ferred attributes (red, cold, blue, round, green) align with the given rules.  .\n   - The only explicit attributes of Anne (big and rough) are consistent with the deductions.\n\nThus, **Anne must be blue** based on the logical chain of rules. The answer is **A) True**. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
