tradicts Rule 5 (white things are not young) because Fiona is young.\n   - Therefore, Fiona **cannot be smart** (as that would force a contradiction).\n\n5. **Conclusion:** Fiona cannot be green via either path. Thus, \"Fiona is not green\" is **true**. \n\n**Answer:** A) True",
