y stated to be round (Premise 2), substituting \"the cat\" into Premise 17 yields the conclusion that **the cat eats the cat**. There is no contradiction with other premises, as \"eats\" does not inherently exclude self-reference in the context provided. Thus, the statement is **true**.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
