rrel." This means big entities must visit the squirrel, but it doesn’t require the squirrel itself to be big.  .\n\n4. **Conclusion**:  .\n   - The squirrel could be big or not, but there’s insufficient information to confirm either. No contradictions arise from assuming either possibility. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 55%|#####4    | 329/600 [3:04:00<1:45:44, 23.41s/it]
