rue or false, but there is insufficient data to determine it definitively.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - Since there is no evidence to prove or disprove the tiger seeing itself, the statement\u2019s truth value cannot be determined. \n\n**Answer**: C) Unknown",
