le 7 ("All round people are not furry"), Charlie is **not furry**.\n\n2. **Applying Rule 8**:.\n   - Rule 8 states: "If someone is cold and not furry, then they are white.".\n   - Charlie meets both conditions (cold and not furry), so he must be **white**.\n\n**Conclusion**: The statement "Charlie is white" is **true** based on the logical deductions from the rules provided. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 85%|########4 | 508/600 [4:43:12<37:40, 24.57s/it]
